#: ../../00-overview.md:40 c1c97c10f8ce418499fa830f2b7b4c55
msgid "00. Project Overview"
msgstr "00. 项目概述"

#: ../../00-overview.md:44 5496570cafe5402a8907bf0ca572400e
msgid ""
"OpenResty is an open-source web platform that integrates an enhanced "
"Nginx core with LuaJIT, turning the Nginx event model into an application"
" runtime where Lua scripts drive HTTP processing and non-blocking I/O to "
"remote backends. It is a higher-level application and gateway platform "
"that uses Nginx as a component, **not** an Nginx fork. See the [Akamai "
"\"Using OpenResty\" guide](https://www.akamai.com/cloud/guides/using-"
"openresty/) and [openresty.org](https://openresty.org/en/)."
msgstr ""
"OpenResty 是一个开源 Web 平台，它将增强版的 Nginx 内核与 LuaJIT 集成在一起，把 Nginx "
"的事件模型变成一个应用运行时：由 Lua 脚本驱动 HTTP 处理以及与远端后端之间的非阻塞 I/O。它是以 Nginx "
"作为组件的更高层应用与网关平台，**而不是** Nginx 的分支。参见 [Akamai “Using OpenResty” "
"指南](https://www.akamai.com/cloud/guides/using-openresty/) 和 "
"[openresty.org](https://openresty.org/en/)。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:52 412cc40b8a29418cbcb12cea1b3dd275
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../00-overview.md:54 401cf34fc3604306a6c54741c796f19d
