"This repository is an **OpenResty Primer**: a Project Knowledge Base and "
"reading companion for working with OpenResty - Nginx plus LuaJIT "
"(ngx_lua). It serves both human engineers and AI assistants who need to"
msgstr ""
"本仓库是一本 **OpenResty 入门手册**：面向 OpenResty（Nginx 加 LuaJIT，即 "
"ngx_lua）的项目知识库与源码阅读伴侣。它同时服务于人类工程师和 AI 助手，帮助他们："

