msgid "**locate** how OpenResty/ngx_lua behaves in the source tree,"
msgstr "**定位** OpenResty/ngx_lua 在源码树中的行为，"

#: ../../00-overview.md:59 b0649ede1cac4ff69a29ec7988de8f96
msgid "**understand** the architecture around HTTP cosockets and DNS resolution,"
msgstr "**理解** HTTP cosocket 与 DNS 解析相关的架构，"

