#: ../../00-overview.md:64 c64b6f8e0e654a64b88cb9976b645404
msgid ""
"The current focus is the **DNS-resolution failure path**: how a hostname "
"lookup fails through `ngx_resolver`, HTTP cosockets, and upstreams, plus "
"the `content`-phase directives of `lua-nginx-module` (e.g. "
"`content_by_lua_file`)."
msgstr ""
"当前重点是 **DNS 解析失败路径**：主机名查询如何经由 `ngx_resolver`、HTTP cosocket 和上游失败，以及 "
"`lua-nginx-module` 的 `content` 阶段指令（例如 `content_by_lua_file`）。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:68 b77f2141ea6742908a4996d5d1ae1ff7
msgid "What OpenResty Is"
msgstr "OpenResty 是什么"

#: ../../00-overview.md:70 312c1b5f23ae4477a1ad3fa92f16aed4
msgid ""
"OpenResty is a web platform that **embeds LuaJIT 2.0/2.1 into Nginx**. "
"`lua-nginx-module` (ngx_lua) is its core component - \"if you are using "
"this module, then you are essentially using OpenResty\". Since ngx_lua "
"`v0.10.16` the standard PUC-Rio Lua interpreter is no longer supported; "
"\"Lua\" here always means LuaJIT."
msgstr ""
"OpenResty 是一个**把 LuaJIT 2.0/2.1 嵌入 Nginx** 的 Web 平台。`lua-nginx-"
"module`（ngx_lua）是它的核心组件——“如果你在使用这个模块，那你本质上就是在使用 OpenResty”。自 ngx_lua "
"`v0.10.16` 起，标准的 PUC-Rio Lua 解释器不再受支持；本文中的 “Lua” 始终指 LuaJIT。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:76 1d1f046aa6b44490b1b8f703dca9da96
msgid ""
"The design intent is to run the server-side application *inside* the "
"Nginx worker, so a request never leaves the event loop to reach a "
"backend. Typical uses include access control and security checks before a"
" request reaches the upstream, mashing up several upstreams, choosing an "
"upstream on the fly from data in Redis/MySQL, complex URL dispatch at the"
" rewrite phase, arbitrary response-header manipulation, and custom "
"caching for subrequests."
msgstr ""
"其设计意图是让服务端应用直接运行在 Nginx worker "
"*内部*，使请求无需离开事件循环即可访问后端。典型用途包括：在请求到达上游之前做访问控制与安全检查、聚合多个上游的输出、根据 "
"Redis/MySQL 中的数据动态选择上游、在 rewrite 阶段做复杂的 URL 分发、任意修改响应头，以及为子请求实现自定义缓存。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:83 500579c5f9b74b7f9334b13c564950fd
msgid "Strengths and Limitations"
msgstr "优点与局限"

#: ../../00-overview.md:85 40992f7f4b26494fa7aff20d53c2684a
#, fuzzy
msgid "strength"
msgstr "优点"

#: ../../00-overview.md:86 4d094632fc3b481394d59aacb8be9bdd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Lua code can be **100% non-blocking** on network traffic, as long as the "
"Nginx API for Lua is used for upstream access (MySQL, PostgreSQL, "
"Memcached, Redis, HTTP)."
msgstr ""
"只要使用 Nginx API for Lua 访问上游（MySQL、PostgreSQL、Memcached、Redis、HTTP），Lua "
"代码在网络 I/O 上可以做到 **100% 非阻塞**"

#: ../../00-overview.md:87 5cd7029d5f274412a16e89b4905c553c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Performance is \"comparable with native C programs\" in CPU time and "
"memory footprint, thanks to LuaJIT 2.x."
msgstr "得益于 LuaJIT 2.x，在 CPU 时间和内存占用上的性能“可与原生 C 程序相媲美”"

#: ../../00-overview.md:88 58c02a43dac7420b96a00e4e2c6f6e28
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One Lua VM per worker is shared by all requests, with request isolation "
"via lightweight coroutines, resulting in a small memory footprint under "
"heavy load."
msgstr "每个 worker 一个 Lua VM 并由所有请求共享，通过轻量协程实现请求隔离——高负载下内存占用依然很小"

#: ../../00-overview.md:89 a630dbeb82104da387accb2e1dec03e5
#, fuzzy
msgid "Loaded Lua modules persist at worker level, so hot code is compiled once."
msgstr "已加载的 Lua 模块在 worker 级别常驻，热点代码只编译一次"

#: ../../00-overview.md:90 1afd5b9c2d48434da66d1b3815f4bec7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A rich `lua-resty-*` ecosystem (redis, mysql, memcached, dns, lock, "
