#: ../../00-overview.md:95 ddde7147c2a844e8b55a33f304fd98b0
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Blocking the worker is easy to do by accident: any library that is not "
"cosocket-based (plain `io.*`, LuaSocket, `os.execute`) stalls every "
"request on that worker."
msgstr ""
"很容易不小心阻塞 worker：任何非基于 cosocket 的库（裸 `io.*`、LuaSocket、`os.execute`）都会卡住该 "
"worker 上的所有请求"

#: ../../00-overview.md:96 b761c027608b4b35bb505bcb1d879847
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Only the **HTTP subsystem** is addressed downstream (HTTP "
"0.9/1.0/1.1/2.0, WebSocket); generic downstream TCP needs the separate "
"`ngx_stream_lua` module."
msgstr ""
"对下游只覆盖 **HTTP 子系统**（HTTP 0.9/1.0/1.1/2.0、WebSocket）；通用的下游 TCP 需要独立的 "
"`ngx_stream_lua` 模块"

#: ../../00-overview.md:97 8f05b06d395e41fd9a40d6643d41404f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Lua **global** variables are per-request and cleared at request end; "
"misusing them causes cross-request surprises, table lookups, and hard-to-"
"debug typos. Always `local x = require('x')`."
msgstr ""
"Lua **全局**变量是按请求隔离的，并在请求结束时被清除；误用会带来跨请求的意外、额外的表查找以及难以排查的拼写错误。请始终使用 `local"
" x = require('x')`"

#: ../../00-overview.md:98 708e786f7ebb4f91b77d04815eb85711
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`dofile`/`require` are C functions in LuaJIT, so calling a yielding API "
"(`ngx.location.capture`, `ngx.exit`, ...) at a Lua file's *top-level* "
"scope raises \"attempt to yield across C-call boundary\"."
msgstr ""
"`dofile`/`require` 在 LuaJIT 中是 C 函数，因此在 Lua 文件的*顶层*作用域调用会让出的 "
"API（`ngx.location.capture`、`ngx.exit` 等）会抛出 “attempt to yield across "
"C-call boundary”"

#: ../../00-overview.md:99 14495ca06c7c42afaea5fd8f7079d22c
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Not every phase can yield: directives injected into "
"`ngx_http_rewrite_module` (e.g. `set_by_lua`) cannot use cosockets, "
"sleeping, or light threads."
msgstr ""
"并非所有阶段都能让出：注入到 `ngx_http_rewrite_module` 的指令（如 `set_by_lua`）无法使用 "
"cosocket、sleep 或 light thread"

#: ../../00-overview.md:100 4e4b25b43ed84adeb53b11f7bcee7649
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`lua_code_cache off` runs every request in a **separate Lua VM**; it is "
"dev-only and can drop \"hello world\" throughput by an order of "
"magnitude."
msgstr ""
"`lua_code_cache off` 会让每个请求运行在**独立的 Lua VM** 中；它仅适用于开发环境，可能让 “hello "
"world” 的吞吐下降一个数量级"

#: ../../00-overview.md:101 60267a795098402d81586d2f35e2170d
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Platform wart: on macOS `tcpsock:connect` may report success even for "
"`Connection Refused`; the real error only surfaces on the next cosocket "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"平台瑕疵：在 macOS 上，即使是 `Connection Refused`，`tcpsock:connect` "
"也可能报告成功；真正的错误要到下一次 cosocket 操作时才暴露"

#: ../../00-overview.md:103 69a39b5449a1481ba717843a83d3c6b3
msgid "Programming Model: Synchronous Code, Non-blocking I/O"
msgstr "编程模型：同步写法，非阻塞 I/O"

#: ../../00-overview.md:105 fc659db44f914a9298639daeed36c28b
msgid ""
"The defining property of ngx_lua is that application code **reads like "
"blocking code but executes without blocking the worker**: you write "
"\"synchronous but still non-blocking access to the database backends and "
"other storage\"."
msgstr ""
"ngx_lua 最本质的特性是：应用代码**读起来像阻塞代码，执行时却不会阻塞 "
"worker**——也就是“以同步方式但仍然非阻塞地访问数据库后端和其他存储”。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:109 3ae5c7de7f0b47a49e84b10ccdd2e628
msgid ""
"**Coroutines as the request context.** Nginx's event model is callback-"
"driven; ngx_lua integrates Lua coroutines into it so each request handler"
" is a coroutine. The Lua VM is shared across all requests of a worker to "
"minimise memory, and \"request contexts are segregated using lightweight "
"Lua coroutines\". Each `*_by_lua*` handler runs as a newly spawned "
"coroutine in an independent global environment (a sandbox)."
msgstr ""
"**以协程承载请求上下文。** Nginx 的事件模型是回调驱动的；ngx_lua 把 Lua 协程集成进来，使每个请求处理器都是一个协程。Lua"
" VM 在一个 worker 的所有请求之间共享以最小化内存，而“请求上下文通过轻量级 Lua 协程相互隔离”。每个 `*_by_lua*` "
"处理器都作为新派生的协程运行在独立的全局环境（沙箱）中。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:115 6811432468f34125bf3f3e92bc690993
msgid ""
"**Light threads.** `ngx.thread.spawn` creates a \"light thread\" - a "
"special Lua coroutine scheduled by ngx_lua - to run work concurrently "
"within one request. The handler body itself is a boilerplate light thread"
" called the *entry thread*. Scheduling is cooperative, not preemptive: a "
"light thread runs exclusively until it yields on I/O, so CPU-bound Lua "
"still blocks its worker."
msgstr ""
"**Light thread（轻线程）。** `ngx.thread.spawn` 会创建一个 “light thread”——由 ngx_lua"
" 调度的特殊 Lua 协程——以便在同一个请求内并发执行任务。处理器主体本身就是一个样板 light thread，称为 *entry "
"thread*。调度是协作式而非抢占式的：light thread 会独占运行直到在 I/O 上让出，因此 CPU 密集型 Lua 仍会阻塞其 "
"worker。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:120 8136f2a64a104a35a373d70bcdf530fd
msgid ""
"**Cosockets.** `ngx.socket.tcp()` returns a *cosocket*: an API "
"intentionally compatible with LuaSocket's TCP API but \"100% nonblocking "
"out of the box\". Under the hood a `connect`/`receive`/`send` yields the "
"coroutine back to the Nginx event loop and resumes it when the event "
"fires. Cosockets support timeouts, TLS handshakes, connection pooling "
"(`setkeepalive`), and since `0.9.9` full-duplex use by one reader and one"
" writer light thread. A cosocket has **exactly the lifetime of the "
"handler that created it** - it must never be shared across requests or "
"passed into a timer callback."
msgstr ""
"**Cosocket。** `ngx.socket.tcp()` 返回一个 *cosocket*：其 API 有意与 LuaSocket 的 "
"TCP API 保持兼容，但“开箱即用地 100% 非阻塞”。在底层，`connect`/`receive`/`send` 会把协程让回 "
"Nginx 事件循环，并在事件触发时恢复。Cosocket 支持超时、TLS 握手、连接池（`setkeepalive`），并自 `0.9.9` "
"起支持由一个读 light thread 和一个写 light thread 进行全双工操作。cosocket "
"的**生命周期与创建它的处理器完全一致**——绝不能跨请求共享，也不能传入定时器回调。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:128 27a630dbb3fc45cb88c0ef48314da435
msgid ""
"**Hostname resolution is part of this model.** A cosocket `connect()` to "
"a name does not call `getaddrinfo()`; it drives Nginx's own "
"`ngx_resolver` and yields while the DNS query is in flight - which is "
"precisely the failure path this PKB documents in "
"[Workflows](06-workflows.md)."
msgstr ""
"**主机名解析也是该模型的一部分。** cosocket 对名称执行 `connect()` 时不会调用 `getaddrinfo()`；它驱动 "
"Nginx 自己的 `ngx_resolver`，并在 DNS "
"查询进行期间让出——这正是本知识库在[工作流](06-workflows.md)中记录的失败路径。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:132 0674257615d84dac88c4a9592c8aafd7
msgid ""
"**Dynamic behaviour.** Lua is loaded at runtime, so routing, access "
"rules, and upstream selection can be computed per request. "
"`*_by_lua_file` paths may contain Nginx variables for dynamic dispatch "
"(with the matching injection risk), files may hold precompiled LuaJIT "
"bytecode, and `lua_code_cache off` gives an edit-and-refresh loop during "
"development. See [lua-nginx-module Directive Reference](08-lua-nginx-"
"module.md)."
msgstr ""
"**动态特性。** Lua 在运行时加载，因此路由、访问规则和上游选择都可以按请求计算。`*_by_lua_file` 的路径中可以包含 "
"Nginx 变量以实现动态分发（同时也带来相应的注入风险），文件中可以存放预编译的 LuaJIT 字节码，而 `lua_code_cache "
"off` 则在开发期提供“改完即刷新”的循环。参见 [lua-nginx-module 指令参考](08-lua-nginx-"
"module.md)。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:139 9a03e21df5934ecc87782b2031f32c59
msgid "How Nginx and LuaJIT Fit Together"
msgstr "Nginx 与 LuaJIT 如何丝滑结合"

#: ../../00-overview.md:141 624f1eeb4c564283b39709992e0ca7d9
msgid ""
"The integration is deliberately seamless rather than a bolt-on scripting "
"layer:"
msgstr "这种集成是刻意做到无缝的，而不是外挂一层脚本："

#: ../../00-overview.md:143 87a326e698f5493ba10415943fede119
msgid ""
"**LuaJIT lives inside the worker process**, not in an external "
"interpreter or a FastCGI sidecar, so there is no IPC on the request path "
"and the JIT keeps hot handlers close to C speed."
msgstr ""
"**LuaJIT 运行在 worker 进程内部**，而不是外部解释器或 FastCGI 边车进程，因此请求路径上没有 IPC，JIT "
"让热点处理器的速度接近 C。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:146 5b46fbe774a34fcb8089021cdd1254b5
msgid ""
"**Lua hooks onto Nginx's request phases.** Handler directives map onto "
"the existing phase machinery (`set_by_lua*`, `rewrite_by_lua*`, "
"`access_by_lua*`, `content_by_lua*`, `header_filter_by_lua*`, "
"`body_filter_by_lua*`, `log_by_lua*`, plus `init_by_lua*` and "
"`ngx.timer.*`), so Lua extends the pipeline instead of replacing it."
msgstr ""
"**Lua 挂接到 Nginx 的请求阶段上。** "
"处理器指令映射到既有的阶段机制（`set_by_lua*`、`rewrite_by_lua*`、`access_by_lua*`、`content_by_lua*`、`header_filter_by_lua*`、`body_filter_by_lua*`、`log_by_lua*`，以及"
" `init_by_lua*` 和 `ngx.timer.*`），因此 Lua 是在扩展流水线而非替换它。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:151 1ae01bba6db54574954b37caa7df3b2c
msgid ""
"**Lua reuses the Nginx runtime**, not its own: the same event loop, the "
"same `resolver`, the same upstream/proxy machinery, SSL stack, shared "
"memory zones (`lua_shared_dict`), logging, and timers."
msgstr ""
"**Lua 复用 Nginx 的运行时**而非自建一套：相同的事件循环、相同的 `resolver`、相同的上游/代理机制、SSL "
"栈、共享内存区（`lua_shared_dict`）、日志与定时器。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:154 5ffe662c08e941b4a639d962852e9172
msgid ""
"**Nginx C modules remain reachable** from Lua through "
"`ngx.location.capture` subrequests, although the `lua-resty-*` libraries "
"are usually preferred as more flexible and memory-efficient."
msgstr ""
"**Nginx 的 C 模块依然可从 Lua 访问**，通过 `ngx.location.capture` 子请求即可，尽管通常更推荐 `lua-"
"resty-*` 库，因为它们更灵活、更省内存。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:157 b986046d9da346b09c6f95a31404534a
msgid ""
"**OpenResty is not an Nginx fork.** It is a higher-level platform that "
"bundles an enhanced Nginx core, an enhanced LuaJIT, vetted Lua libraries,"
" and third-party C modules, so the standard Nginx configuration knowledge"
" carries over unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**OpenResty 不是 Nginx 的分支。** 它是一个更高层的平台，打包了增强版 Nginx 内核、增强版 LuaJIT、经过甄选的 "
"Lua 库以及第三方 C 模块，因此标准的 Nginx 配置知识可以原封不动地沿用。"

