#: ../../00-overview.md:186 f483f8c2fca241209ff2803cb7b23e67
msgid ""
"**Deployment model**: documentation knowledge base (not a deployable "
"application). There is no server to run to \"use\" the PKB itself."
msgstr "**部署模型**：文档知识库（并非可部署的应用）。使用本知识库本身不需要运行任何服务。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:188 f217f395465a4f1fb92dfaf4a7bb7213
msgid ""
"**Core runtime shape**: Sphinx + MyST bilingual site; the documented "
"subject is the OpenResty runtime (Nginx event loop + LuaJIT coroutines)."
msgstr ""
"**核心运行时形态**：Sphinx + MyST 双语站点；所记录的对象是 OpenResty 运行时（Nginx 事件循环 + LuaJIT "
"协程）。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:190 d8ecb51cc1dd4a3695b12cfc9bfedba2
msgid ""
"**Primary data path**: request -> `ngx_lua` cosocket or upstream -> "
"`ngx_resolver` -> configured nameservers (see "
"[Workflows](06-workflows.md))."
msgstr ""
"**主要数据路径**：请求 -> `ngx_lua` cosocket 或上游 -> `ngx_resolver` -> "
"所配置的域名服务器（参见[工作流](06-workflows.md)）。"

#: ../../00-overview.md:192 790bcd3770184863b632a1acbe713f10
msgid ""
"**Top risk or constraint**: facts must stay locked to verified source "
"versions (nginx 1.31.1, ngx_lua 0.10.31rc5, lua-nginx-module README); "
"drift in upstream code can silently invalidate the docs."
msgstr ""
"**首要风险或约束**：事实必须锁定在已验证的源码版本上（nginx 1.31.1、ngx_lua 0.10.31rc5、lua-nginx-"
"module README）；上游代码的漂移会悄无声息地让文档失效。"

